  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 6160 days before the posting",
  "headline_cites": ["E4", "E14"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "The product label for amiodarone hydrochloride (NDC 71335194204) identifies Bryant Ranch Prepack as the registered plant with FEI 1000519407.",
      "cites": ["E14"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 590126 of that plant ended on 2009-06-11 and was classified Official Action Indicated (OAI) with six observations including lack of a written stability program and complaint investigation deficiencies.",
      "cites": ["E4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The OAI classification became known to FDA on 2009-09-09, which is 6160 days before the posting date of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["E4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Subsequent inspections of the same plant from 2010 through 2026-07-16 have all been classified Voluntary Action Indicated (VAI).",
      "cites": ["E5", "E6", "E7", "E8", "E9", "E10", "E11", "E12"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A Warning Letter was issued to the plant on 2010-04-08 following the OAI inspection.",
      "cites": ["E13"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 144 units with 10 days on hand at 14.7 units per day, while Corvale General holds 268 units with 18 days on hand at 15 units per day.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Transferring 58 units from Corvale General to Corvale East would leave Corvale General with 14 days on hand and bring Corvale East to 14 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    }
  ]
}
